<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xsd:schema xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
	xmlns:Q1="http://ei/core/addressx2"
	targetNamespace="http://ei/core/extended_addressx2">
	<xsd:import namespace="http://ei/core/addressx2"
		schemaLocation="AddressX2.xsd" />
	<xsd:complexType name="ExtendedAddress">
		<xsd:complexContent>
			<xsd:extension base="Q1:Address">				<xsd:sequence>					<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="FireDistrictCode"
						type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>
This element is a code assigned by the State to identify the a Municipal Fire Department District. 
Valid options for this element are in the RAND system.
						</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
					</xsd:element>
					<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="TaxIdentityCode"
						type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>
This element is the political subdivisions code assigned to a location within a state for tax purposes.
Valid options for this element are in the RAND system.
							</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
					</xsd:element>
					<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="FreeTradeZoneClass"
						type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>
							
This element indentifies the class code of policies written in the Free Trade Zone, which is a special risk insurance market.
Valid options for this element are '1' - Class 1 Risks or '2' - Class 2 Risks.
							</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
					</xsd:element>
					<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="FreeTradeZoneCode"
						type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>
This element is the postal abbreviation for the location of the Free Trade Zone.
								</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
					</xsd:element>
					<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
						name="FreeTradeZoneRiskCode" type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>
This element identifies the risks via a code that can be written in the Free Trade Zone as Class II Risks.
The  E1T01361 Corporate Table contains valid values for this element in the &quot;FREE_TRD_ZN_RSK_C&quot; column.  
							</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
					</xsd:element>
				</xsd:sequence>
			</xsd:extension>
		</xsd:complexContent>
	</xsd:complexType>
</xsd:schema>
